# patches/series — ordered list of quilt-style patches build-kernel.sh applies (patch -p1).
#
# One patch filename per line, relative to this directory, in apply order.  Blank lines and
# lines starting with '#' are ignored.  This file ships EMPTY: Lindos builds a stock upstream
# kernel by default.  Add BORE / scx / other patches here yourself — see README.md.  Nothing
# is fabricated: no patch contents are shipped in this repository.
#
# Example (uncomment and drop the .patch files next to this file to use):
# 0001-bore-scheduler.patch
